# Security

- Encrypt tokens at rest with AES-GCM; encryption key server-only.
- Never log secrets, tokens, or full credentials.
- Validate MIME by content; limit upload size; block SSRF on URLs.
- Enforce roles server-side; never expose secrets to the client.
